formalpara.para:
      true if both the Producer and Consumer for this
Wire object are connected to the Wire object;
false otherwise.

      false if this Wire object is invalid because it
has been deleted via WireAdmin.deleteWire(Wire);
true otherwise.

section.programlisting:
Integer mask = Integer.valueOf(WIRE_TRACE | WIRE_CONNECTED | WIRE_DISCONNECTED);
Hashtable ht = new Hashtable();
ht.put(WIREADMIN_EVENTS, mask);
context.registerService(WireAdminListener.class.getName(), this, ht);

formalpara.para:
true if obj is a WirePermission, and has the same
         name and actions as this WirePermission object;
         false otherwise.
